<body><main><nav aria-label="Site navigation"><a href="../../">riegulate / portfolio</a><a href="../">Creative Studio OS</a><a href="./">Privacy policy</a></nav><p class="tag">Personal software / Privacy</p><h1>Privacy policy.</h1><p class="muted">Effective November 26, 2026</p><p>This policy describes Creative Studio OS, a private, local-first application operated by Rieg Rodig (Riegulate), based in João Pessoa, Brazil. It is intended for one adult owner, not offered to the general public. Contact: <a href="mailto:riegulate@gmail.com">riegulate@gmail.com</a>.</p><h2>1. Information and purposes</h2><p>The application organizes owner-selected project files, creative media, notes, tasks, calendar information and reference material. Optional integrations request authorization before accessing connected accounts. Information is used to provide the requested personal organization, research and creative workflows, not for advertising, sale or data brokerage.</p><h2>2. Proposed Pinterest access</h2><p>The Pinterest API connection is pending approval and is not active. Its intended scope is read-only access to the authenticated owner's selected boards, sections and Pins, including information needed to display references and source links. Authorization will use Pinterest's supported OAuth flow; the app does not need the owner's Pinterest password or browser cookies.</p><p>The integration will be enabled only after its implementation has been checked against Pinterest's current terms. API-derived reference data is intended for on-demand display, not persistent storage, redistribution, or creation of a separate dataset. No write, advertising or engagement permissions are requested.</p><h2>3. Local storage and credentials</h2><p>Owner-authored project records and notes may be retained locally for as long as needed for the owner's work. Integration credentials are intended to be restricted to the owner's computer and excluded from public repositories and logs. Credentials and local records can be removed when no longer needed. The Pinterest viewer must not persist API-derived content except where expressly permitted by Pinterest.</p><h2>4. AI and third parties</h2><p>The wider application supports local AI and optional external AI services for authorized tasks. Any separately authorized transfer of personal project material is subject to the selected provider's terms and privacy policy. Pinterest API data will be excluded from external AI requests, persistent AI memory, model training and model improvement unless expressly permitted by Pinterest and appropriately authorized. The app does not sell personal information or share Pinterest API data with third parties.</p><h2>5. Public website</h2><p>These information pages are hosted on GitHub Pages. They do not include an account login, contact form, tracking script or the local application's data. GitHub may process technical request information to deliver and secure the website under its <a href="https://docs.github.com/en/site-policy/privacy-policies/github-general-privacy-statement">privacy statement</a>. External links are governed by their respective providers' policies.</p><h2>6. Control, revocation and deletion</h2><p>The owner can stop an integration, revoke access through the relevant account's connected-app settings, and remove local credentials and associated records. For Pinterest, see <a href="https://www.pinterest.com/settings/apps/">connected apps settings</a> and the <a href="https://policy.pinterest.com/en/privacy-policy">Pinterest Privacy Policy</a>. Questions and applicable requests for access, correction or deletion may be sent to the contact address above.</p><h2>7. Changes</h2><p>This policy will be updated before materially different data processing or new public access is introduced. The proposed Pinterest integration is subject to <a href="https://developers.pinterest.com/terms/">Pinterest Developer and API Terms</a> and <a href="https://policy.pinterest.com/en/developer-guidelines">Developer Guidelines</a>.</p><p class="muted">Creative Studio OS is independent and is not affiliated with or endorsed by Pinterest.</p><footer>Riegulate · Independent creative practice · João Pessoa, Brazil<br/><a href="mailto:riegulate@gmail.com">riegulate@gmail.com</a></footer></main></body></html>